    "text": "- **HAP:** ≥48 hours after admission, not incubating at admission. **VAP:** ≥48 hours after intubation.\n- **MDR risk factors (HAP/VAP):** IV antibiotics within 90 days; prior MDR colonisation/infection.\n- **Additional MDR risk factors (VAP):** septic shock at VAP; ARDS or acute RRT before VAP; ≥5 days\n  hospitalisation before VAP."
