    "text": "- **Preferred:** Amoxicillin/clavulanate 1.2g IV q8h, 5–7 days\n- **Alternative:** Ceftriaxone 2g IV q24h, 5–7 days\n- **Comments:** Adjust to local antibiogram; consider broader spectrum if deteriorating on adequate therapy."
