    "text": "- **Preferred:** Ceftriaxone 500mg IM STAT (BW >150kg: 1g IM STAT) PLUS Azithromycin 1g PO STAT (if chlamydia not excluded)\n- **Alternative:** Anaphylaxis or severe cephalosporin reaction: consult for expert opinion\n- **Comments:** Partner management and abstinence as above."
