    "text": "- **Preferred**\n  - Arthritis-dermatitis syndrome: Ceftriaxone 1g IV/IM q24h for 7 days\n  - Purulent arthritis: Ceftriaxone 1g IV/IM q24h for 7–14 days\n  - Meningitis: Ceftriaxone 1–2g IV q12h–24h for 10–14 days\n  - Endocarditis: Ceftriaxone 1–2g IV q12h–24h for 4–6 weeks\n- **Alternative:** Arthritis-dermatitis syndrome: Cefotaxime 1g IV q8h for 7 days\n- **Comments:** Partner management and abstinence as above."
