    "path": "NAG Section A (Adult) — Sexually Transmitted Infections (STIs) › 2. Urethral Discharge › 2.3 Non-gonococcal urethritis (NGU) › 2.3.1 First episode",
    "group": "Adult",
    "text": "- **Preferred:** Doxycycline 100mg PO q12h for 7 days\n- **Alternative:** Azithromycin 500mg PO STAT, then 250mg q24h for 4 days\n- **Comments:** Partner management and abstinence as above; consider empiric chlamydia treatment for partners."
