    "group": "Adult",
    "text": "- **Preferred**\n  - If first-line was doxycycline: Azithromycin 500mg PO STAT, then 250mg PO q24h for 4 days PLUS\n    Metronidazole 400mg PO q12h for 5 days\n  - If first-line was azithromycin: \\*Moxifloxacin 400mg PO q24h for 10–14 days PLUS Metronidazole\n    400mg PO q24h for 5 days *(dosing frequency as printed in the source; differs from q12h above)*\n- **Comments:** Partner management and abstinence as above; consider empiric chlamydia treatment for\n  partners. \\*Indication not in MOH Drug Formulary."
