    "text": "- **Preferred:** Metronidazole 400mg PO q12h for 7 days; OR Metronidazole 2g PO STAT\\*\n- **Comments:** Treat partners simultaneously. Abstain from sex for 1 week after treatment and\n  symptom resolution. \\*Single high-dose metronidazole has more GI side effects and a higher failure\n  rate, especially if partners are not treated concurrently."
