    "text": "- **Preferred:** Amoxicillin/clavulanate 1.2g IV q6–8h; OR Ampicillin/sulbactam 3g IV q6h\n- **Alternative:** Cefuroxime 750–1500mg IV q8h; OR Ceftriaxone 2g IV q24h; OR \\*Ciprofloxacin 400mg IV q12h\n- **Comments:** Surgical drainage is the mainstay. \\*Ciprofloxacin 500–750mg PO q12h may be considered\n  as outpatient treatment for small abscesses not suitable for drainage."
