    "text": "Source: MOH Malaysia National Antimicrobial Guideline (NAG), Section B Paediatrics\n(B9 Otorhinolaryngology, B10 Respiratory, B11 Skin & Soft Tissue, B13 Urinary Tract),\nhttps://sites.google.com/moh.gov.my/nag/contents/section-b-paediatrics\nTranscribed from text supplied by the project owner. Reference data only — not yet wired into\n`src/lib/nagPathways.ts`. All doses are as printed in the source; \"max.\" values are per the source.\n\nPublisher (per source): Pharmaceutical Services Programme, Ministry of Health Malaysia, © 2024,\ne-ISBN 978-967-2854-47-0."
