    "text": "- **Preferred**\n  - <10 years or <40kg: Rifampicin 10mg/kg PO (max. 600mg) once monthly; PLUS Dapsone 2mg/kg PO q24h\n    (max. 100mg/day); PLUS Clofazimine 100mg PO once monthly and 50mg twice weekly\n  - 10–14 years and >40kg: Rifampicin 450mg PO (max. 600mg) once monthly; PLUS Dapsone 50mg PO q24h\n    (max. 100mg/day); PLUS Clofazimine 150mg PO once monthly and 50mg on alternate days\n- **Comments:** Paucibacillary: 6 months, surveillance 5 years. Multibacillary: 12 months, surveillance 15 years."
